examples.setup:
What is printed, and in what order?
```c
int x = 7;
if (fork() == 0) {
    x = x * 3;
    printf("%d ", x);
} else {
    wait(NULL);
    x = x + 1;
    printf("%d ", x);
}
```

What values can be printed, and what is their sum?
```c
int i = 0;
if (fork()) { i += 2; } else { i += 3; }
if (fork()) { i += 4; }
printf("%d ", i);
```

Standard output goes to a file, so it is fully buffered. How many characters are written?
```c
printf("A");
fork();
printf("B");
```

